        "message": "feat(GDD-005): GDD-to-test transpiler and drift detection\n\nReplaced the declared P0-002 stub with a real generator: 17 structural\ndrift specs from the DRAFT/SIGNED GDD §15 acceptance lines, 15 STUB modules\nskipped. --check fails when a GDD line changes or a generated file goes stale;\ninjecting a GDD-CORE drift exits 1 and names the module.\n\nSpecs are explicitly structural drift checks, not behavioral proofs; their\nheaders point to docs/state/evidence/ where harness logs live.\n\nCoverage 63/63 = 100%. Blueprint acc extended with the transpiler check.\nCorrected an earlier handoff mislabel: GDD-005 is not a GDD signature task.\n\nGATE:P2 work-side complete; Director signatures for GATE:P2 and GATE:NET\nremain. NET-GATE stays signed-with-risk with 8 unmet criteria; no art.\n\nVerify 19/19, full test green.\n\nAgent: qa-engineer\nTask: GDD-005",
